00:02:46.595 --> 00:02:49.455
kind of weird cause uh- when you're in school in the center like

00:02:49.455 --> 00:02:51.625
a far, far away school you don't really get

00:02:51.625 --> 00:02:54.545
that many friends in your own neighbourhood, uh

00:02:54.545 --> 00:02:58.800
classmates just live all across Gothenburg and I remember [laughs]

00:02:58.800 --> 00:02:59.825
there was one point when my parents were like-

00:02:59.825 --> 00:03:03.955
"it's Saturday, why don't you go out with friends" but I'm like- "all my friends are super far away"

00:03:03.955 --> 00:03:06.715
